<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Maintenance Mode | Chef Nitesh Sharma</title>
  <!-- Google Fonts -->
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;800&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <!-- FontAwesome -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
  
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #0f1115;
      --accent: #d4af37; /* Metallic Gold */
      --text-main: #f3f4f6;
      --text-muted: #9ca3af;
      --glow: rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.15);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      background-color: var(--bg-dark);
      font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
      color: var(--text-main);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
    }

    /* Ambient Background Glows */
    .glow-orb {
      position: absolute;
      width: 400px;
      height: 400px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--glow) 0%, rgba(15,17,21,0) 70%);
      filter: blur(40px);
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .orb-1 { top: -100px; right: -100px; }
    .orb-2 { bottom: -100px; left: -100px; }

    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      padding: 40px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      z-index: 2;
      animation: fadeIn 1.2s ease-out;
    }

    /* Chef Icon / Pulsing Graphic */
    .chef-icon-container {
      position: relative;
      width: 100px;
      height: 100px;
      margin: 0 auto 30px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .pulse-ring {
      position: absolute;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border: 2px solid var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
      animation: pulse 2.5s infinite;
      opacity: 0;
    }

    .chef-icon {
      font-size: 3rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.4));
      animation: gentle-float 4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    h1.brand-name {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-size: 2.2rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: var(--text-main);
    }

    h2.tagline {
      font-size: 1rem;
      font-weight: 300;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .maintenance-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 40px 30px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    }

    .maintenance-title {
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }

    .maintenance-text {
      color: var(--text-muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    /* Dynamic loading dots */
    .loading-dots {
      display: inline-flex;
      gap: 6px;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      background-color: var(--accent);
      border-radius: 50%;
      opacity: 0.3;
      animation: dot-glow 1.5s infinite;
    }
    .dot:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.3s; }
    .dot:nth-child(3) { animation-delay: 0.6s; }

    /* Footer link to admin */
    .admin-link {
      margin-top: 40px;
      display: inline-block;
      color: var(--text-muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      transition: color 0.3s ease;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .admin-link:hover {
      color: var(--accent);
      opacity: 1;
    }

    /* Animations */
    @keyframes fadeIn {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px); }
      to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0% { transform: scale(0.8); opacity: 0.5; }
      50% { opacity: 0.3; }
      100% { transform: scale(1.4); opacity: 0; }
    }

    @keyframes gentle-float {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
      50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
    }

    @keyframes dot-glow {
      0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.3; }
      50% { transform: scale(1.3); opacity: 1; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  
  <div class="glow-orb orb-1"></div>
  <div class="glow-orb orb-2"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="chef-icon-container">
      <div class="pulse-ring"></div>
      <i class="fa-solid fa-utensils chef-icon"></i>
    </div>

    <h1 class="brand-name">Chef Nitesh Sharma</h1>
    <h2 class="tagline">Crafting Stories on a Plate</h2>

    <div class="maintenance-card">
      <h3 class="maintenance-title">Cooking Up Something New</h3>
      <p class="maintenance-text">
        We are currently refreshing our digital menu and recipes. The kitchen will be open again very soon with exciting culinary updates.
      </p>
      <div class="loading-dots">
        <span class="dot"></span>
        <span class="dot"></span>
        <span class="dot"></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <a href="/admin/login" class="admin-link">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i> STAFF PORTAL
    </a>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
